algebraic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"connectivity, of the Laplacian (or of the normalized Laplacian), with one entry per vertex.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory\/FiedlerVector","title":"FiedlerVector"}}}